      "imageRatio": "36",
      "alt": "Reduce Bandwidth & Storage Costs",
      "text": "<h3>Reduce Bandwidth &amp; Storage Costs</h3>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0\">Ambarella compression technologies dramatically reduce data transmission size, slashing storage costs and bandwidth usage with Ambarella products.</p>",
