      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/ambarella/images/lens-blue-background.jpg",
      "imageRatio": "36",
      "alt": "Image Quality",
      "text": "<h3>Image Quality</h3>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0\">One of the hallmarks of Ambarella processors is our image processing pipeline. Encompassing everything from HDR to EIS to dewarping, our state-of-the-art ISP ensures that every frame of every video is exquisite, improving safety and enhancing the viewing experience.</p>",
