      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/ambarella/images/robotics-1280x720.jpeg",
      "imageRatio": "36",
      "alt": "Autonomy",
      "text": "<h3>Autonomy</h3>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0\">From drones to robots, from taxis to long-haul semi trucks, Ambarella’s vision processors were designed to revolutionize the way we work and travel. Our hardware platforms deliver the flexibility required to implement all levels of automation, including partial, conditional, high, and full autonomy.</p>",
